# Typography in context

Typography makes repeated household tasks easy to scan. Apply the readable hierarchy in GOV.UK’s brand guidance through civica.uk’s approved Arial stack and [existing type scale](typography.html). Official font identity and promotional type treatments do not override native Home Assistant usability.

## Examples

These reference examples use invented household details. They do not operate devices or establish that every native Home Assistant surface has adopted this guidance.

